        "code": {
          "text": "Reported right upper abdominal/chest wall symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Swelling, erythema, and itching in the right upper abdomen/chest wall, described as “like sunburn that won’t go away.” Present for at least weeks, probably months; a previous note about six months ago recorded erythema and pigmentation in the same area. The patient reports possibly slightly increased puffiness since the last review."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
